{
 "turns": [
  {
   "idx": 0,
   "speaker": "clinician",
   "text": "Hi, come on in. Have a seat anywhere. I'm Priya Natarajan, one of the psychiatric nurse practitioners here. Can you tell me your full name and date of birth?",
   "start": 0.11,
   "end": 14.58
  },
  {
   "idx": 1,
   "speaker": "patient",
   "text": "Daniella Restripo, May 8th, 1992.",
   "start": 15.37,
   "end": 18.39
  },
  {
   "idx": 2,
   "speaker": "clinician",
   "text": "Thank you, Daniella. Did you find parking okay? That garage is a bit of a maze.",
   "start": 19.55,
   "end": 26.34
  },
  {
   "idx": 3,
   "speaker": "patient",
   "text": "Yes, I ended up all the way on the roof, but it's fine.",
   "start": 27.32,
   "end": 30.1
  },
  {
   "idx": 4,
   "speaker": "clinician",
   "text": "That happens to everyone. So your primary care doctor sent you over. Tell me in your own",
   "start": 30.1,
   "end": 38.38
  },
  {
   "idx": 5,
   "speaker": "patient",
   "text": "- Um, I've just been really down. For about three months now, I don't enjoy anything anymore. I used to paint on the weekends and I haven't touched it since June.",
   "start": 41.61,
   "end": 50.27
  },
  {
   "idx": 6,
   "speaker": "clinician",
   "text": "I'm sorry. That sounds really hard. How's your sleep been?",
   "start": 51.28,
   "end": 56.13
  },
  {
   "idx": 7,
   "speaker": "patient",
   "text": "Bad, I fall asleep okay. But I wake up around four in the morning and I can't get back to sleep.",
   "start": 57.07,
   "end": 62.23
  },
  {
   "idx": 8,
   "speaker": "clinician",
   "text": "And you're appetite?",
   "start": 62.89,
   "end": 63.67
  },
  {
   "idx": 9,
   "speaker": "patient",
   "text": "I'm just not hungry. I think I've lost maybe eight pounds without trying.",
   "start": 64.6,
   "end": 69.44
  },
  {
   "idx": 10,
   "speaker": "clinician",
   "text": "About energy and concentration.",
   "start": 70.16,
   "end": 72.22
  },
  {
   "idx": 11,
   "speaker": "patient",
   "text": "Low energy all the time. At work I read the same email like three times. I'm a project coordinator at Havers & Engineering, and I'm, you know, kind of barely keeping up.",
   "start": 73.3,
   "end": 83.48
  },
  {
   "idx": 12,
   "speaker": "clinician",
   "text": "Did anything happen that set this off?",
   "start": 83.94,
   "end": 86.05
  },
  {
   "idx": 13,
   "speaker": "patient",
   "text": "My relationship ended in the spring. Five years. But honestly, it feels bigger than that now.",
   "start": 86.67,
   "end": 92.05
  },
  {
   "idx": 14,
   "speaker": "clinician",
   "text": "No, that makes sense. Have you ever had a stretch like this before been treated for depression or anxiety?",
   "start": 92.05,
   "end": 101.57
  },
  {
   "idx": 15,
   "speaker": "patient",
   "text": "No this is the first time. I've never been on anything for it.",
   "start": 102.54,
   "end": 106.04
  },
  {
   "idx": 16,
   "speaker": "clinician",
   "text": "Have you ever had time where you felt the opposite, like really high energy and sleep for day racing thought?",
   "start": 106.61,
   "end": 117.5
  },
  {
   "idx": 17,
   "speaker": "patient",
   "text": "No never.",
   "start": 118.62,
   "end": 119.26
  },
  {
   "idx": 18,
   "speaker": "clinician",
   "text": "Anyone in your family, depression, bipolar disorder.",
   "start": 120.09,
   "end": 125.25
  },
  {
   "idx": 19,
   "speaker": "patient",
   "text": "My aunt on my dad's side has bipolar, I think. And my sister Paola takes something for anxiety. I don't know what.",
   "start": 125.81,
   "end": 132.39
  },
  {
   "idx": 20,
   "speaker": "clinician",
   "text": "Okay, ask everyone. Have you had any thoughts that you'd be better off dead? It's of hurting yourself.",
   "start": 133.34,
   "end": 147.29
  },
  {
   "idx": 21,
   "speaker": "patient",
   "text": "No, I feel awful, but no, nothing like that.",
   "start": 148.17,
   "end": 150.25
  },
  {
   "idx": 22,
   "speaker": "clinician",
   "text": "Any thoughts of hurting anyone else?",
   "start": 151.03,
   "end": 153.17
  },
  {
   "idx": 23,
   "speaker": "patient",
   "text": "No!",
   "start": 154.21,
   "end": 154.47
  },
  {
   "idx": 24,
   "speaker": "clinician",
   "text": "Thank you for answering that.",
   "start": 155.24,
   "end": 156.9
  },
  {
   "idx": 25,
   "speaker": "patient",
   "text": "Maybe a glass of wine once a week. No drugs.",
   "start": 160.9,
   "end": 163.4
  },
  {
   "idx": 26,
   "speaker": "clinician",
   "text": "Any medical problems? And are you allergic to any medications?",
   "start": 164.02,
   "end": 168.88
  },
  {
   "idx": 27,
   "speaker": "patient",
   "text": "I'm healthy otherwise. I'm allergic to penicillin. I break out in hives.",
   "start": 168.88,
   "end": 173.84
  },
  {
   "idx": 28,
   "speaker": "clinician",
   "text": "Got it. So the questionnaire you filled out in the waiting... Your score is 15, which is in the moderate range. Your G, a D7 anxiety score, is 6. Blood pressure today is 116 over 74, pulse 72. And so you know what I... Your speech is normal.",
   "start": 174.48,
   "end": 210.84
  },
  {
   "idx": 29,
   "speaker": "patient",
   "text": "Yeah, that sounds about right.",
   "start": 220.92,
   "end": 222.18
  },
  {
   "idx": 30,
   "speaker": "clinician",
   "text": "So here's what I think. This looks like major depression. A single episode like to do is start sertraline. 25 milligrams once a day for one week, up to 50 milligrams once a day. It can take four to six weeks to really feel the difference.",
   "start": 222.18,
   "end": 251.79
  },
  {
   "idx": 31,
   "speaker": "patient",
   "text": "Are there side effects?",
   "start": 252.84,
   "end": 253.64
  },
  {
   "idx": 32,
   "speaker": "clinician",
   "text": "Some people get an uproar or a headache the first week or two, usually fade. Take it when because of your If you ever notice you're suddenly wired, not sleeping, okay, I'd also like you to sign putting in a referral to our therapy TV sessions and I'm giving you this safety plan card. If you ever do have thoughts of hurting yourself, you can call.",
   "start": 254.61,
   "end": 295.11
  },
  {
   "idx": 33,
   "speaker": "patient",
   "text": "Okay, thank you.",
   "start": 306.64,
   "end": 307.34
  },
  {
   "idx": 34,
   "speaker": "clinician",
   "text": "Which pharmacy do you use?",
   "start": 308.18,
   "end": 309.94
  },
  {
   "idx": 35,
   "speaker": "patient",
   "text": "Lakeview Pharmacy on 4120 Belmont Avenue.",
   "start": 310.57,
   "end": 314.21
  },
  {
   "idx": 36,
   "speaker": "clinician",
   "text": "I'll send it there.",
   "start": 314.71,
   "end": 315.75
  },
  {
   "idx": 37,
   "speaker": "patient",
   "text": "773 -555 -0164.",
   "start": 319.62,
   "end": 323.14
  },
  {
   "idx": 38,
   "speaker": "clinician",
   "text": "Great. Let's see you back in four weeks to check how you're doing on the medicine.",
   "start": 324.1,
   "end": 332.34
  },
  {
   "idx": 39,
   "speaker": "patient",
   "text": "Sounds good. Thanks, really.",
   "start": 333.06,
   "end": 334.44
  }
 ],
